="49.314">要给孩</span><span begin="49.314" end="49.805">子</span><span begin="49.805" end="50.454">做一</span><span begin="50.454" end="50.664">个</span><span begin="50.664" end="51.180">好</span><span begin="51.180" end="51.816">的示</span><span begin="51.816" end="53.115">范</span></p><p begin="53.830" end="59.065" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.830" end="54.557">不算</span><span begin="54.557" end="54.774">太</span><span begin="54.774" end="55.919">伟</span><span begin="55.919" end="56.445">岸</span> <span begin="56.541" end="57.228">却是</span><span begin="57.228" end="57.530">我</span><span begin="57.530" end="58.637">榜</span><span begin="58.637" end="59.065">样</span></p><p begin="59.255" end="1:05.016" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.255" end="59.997">以上</span><span begin="59.997" end="1:00.236">是</span><span begin="1:00.236" end="1:00.699">父</span><span begin="1:00.699" end="1:01.413">亲留</span><span begin="1:01.413" end="1:01.651">给</span><span begin="1:01.651" end="1:02.101">我</span><span begin="1:02.101" end="1:02.697">的印</span><span begin="1:02.697" end="1:05.016">象</span></p></div><div begin="1:09.020" end="1:30.797" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:09.020" end="1:14.011" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.020" end="1:10.515">借给你双</span><span begin="1:10.515" end="1:11.295">手</span> <span begin="1:11.295" end="1:12.636">拍拍我肩</span><span begin="1:12.636" end="1:14.011">膀</span></p><p begin="1:14.483" end="1:20.972" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.483" end="1:15.966">借给你双</span><span begin="1:15.966" end="1:16.692">眼</span> <span begin="1:16.692" end="1:18.033">见证我成</span><span begin="1:18.033" end="1:18.742">年</span><span begin="1:18.742" end="1:19.419">模</span><span begin="1:19.419" end="1:20.972">样</span></p><p begin="1:21.959" end="1:30.797" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.959" end="1:23.598">请不要忘记我</span><span begin="1:23.598" end="1:24.436">们</span> <span begin="1:24.832" end="1:26.303